  The survival function is defined as

  .. math::

     f_{sf}(x, a, b) = 1 - f_{cdf}(x, a, b)

  where :math:`f_{cdf}(x, a, b)` is the beta cumulative distribution function,
  :func:`jax.scipy.stats.beta.cdf`.

